CM_ SG_ 1240 HU_AliveStatus "Information of the status of Head Unit
0x00 : Headunit is booting so, Headunit cant display any state
0x01 : Headunit is normal state, Headunit could display according to MM CAN  command.
0x02 : Headunit is doing their internal process, so Headunit cant communicate with other node.
For CLU/SCC/eCall
-AVN System transmission signal";
