BA_ "Description" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_DisSpdDcmlVal "The signal 'CF_Clu_VanzDecimal' means the extra value of the signal 'CF_Clu_Vanz' (vehicle speed which is indicated in the speedometer)
Also, This signal should be sent in km/h or MPH according to the 'CF_Clu_SPEED_UNIT' signal.
CF_Clu_SPEED_UNIT = 0 : [km/h]
CF_Clu_SPEED_UNIT = 1 : [MPH]

Example)   CF_Clu_Vanz = 13,  CF_Clu_VanzDecimal  = 3
Displayed vehicle speed  = (CF_Clu_Vanz / 2) + (CF_Clu_VanzDecimal / 8)
= ( 13 / 2 ) + ( 3 / 8 ) = 6.875 [Km/h or MPH]";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_DisSpdDcmlVal 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_DisSpdDcmlVal 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_DisSpdDcmlVal 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_DisSpdDcmlVal 5;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_DisSpdDcmlVal "17.11.00";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsMainSwSta "Cruise on/off switch";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsMainSwSta 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsMainSwSta 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsMainSwSta 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsMainSwSta 5;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsMainSwSta "18.04.00";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2256644609 CLU_SWRCCrsSwSta "Depending on whether One-touch logic is applied, the meaning of each signal value is divided into two cases as shown below

Case1) Not applied
0x0:Idle Position
0x1:Resume/Plus
0x2:Set/Minus
0x3:Time gap (Distance, SCC only)
0x4:ACC/SCC cancel

Case2) Applied
0x0: Idle Position
0x1: Plus/Set
0x2: Minus/Set
0x3: Time gap (Distance, SCC only)
0x4: Pause/Resume";
