BA_ "Description" SG_ 2214659330 HEV_AccelPdlVal "The signal is a measure of the Accelerator Pedal value.
The accelerator pedal value is determined via 2 pedal sensors, which are connected mechanically to the accelerator pedal. If the EMS-ECU recognizes that the accelerator pedal is not activated, then the value 00 H is carried over on the CAN. If the EMS-ECU detects that the accelerator pedal is fully activated, then 3FE H is carried over on the CAN bus.
If an error is detected on both pedal sensor channels, this is identified by the value 3FFH";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2214659330 HEV_AccelPdlVal 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2214659330 HEV_AccelPdlVal 3;
